face":"தாம்புணர்ந்","parts":[{"text":"தாம்புணர்ந்","lemma":"தாம்புணர்ந்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தமையிற்","parts":[{"text":"தமையிற்","lemma":"தமையிற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பிரிந்தோ","parts":[{"text":"பிரிந்தோ","lemma":"பிரிந்தோ","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ருள்ளத்","parts":[{"text":"ருள்ளத்","lemma":"ருள்ளத்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"தீங்குரல்","parts":[{"text":"தீம்","lemma":"தீமை","gloss":"sweet"},{"text":"குரல்","lemma":"குரல்","gloss":"voice"}],"gloss":"sweet voice"},{"surface":"அகவ","parts":[{"text":"அகவ","lemma":"அகவு","gloss":"to coo"}],"gloss":"to coo"},{"surface":"கேட்டு","parts":[{"text":"கேட்டு","lemma":"கேள்","gloss":"having heard"}],"gloss":"having heard"},{"surface":"நீங்கிய","parts":[{"text":"நீங்கிய","lemma":"நீங்கு","gloss":"who left"}],"gloss":"who left"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஏதிலாளர்","parts":[{"text":"ஏதிலாளர்","lemma":"ஏதிலாளர்","gloss":"stranger"}],"gloss":"stranger"},{"surface":"இவண்","parts":[{"text":"இவண்","lemma":"இவண்","gloss":"here"}],"gloss":"here"},{"surface":"வரின்","parts":[{"text":"வரின்","lemma":"வரு","gloss":"if he comes"}],"gloss":"if he comes"},{"surface":"போதின்","parts":[{"text":"போதின்","lemma":"போதின்","gloss":"like a flower bud"}],"gloss":"like a flower bud"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பொம்மல்","parts":[{"text":"பொம்மல்","lemma":"பொம்மல்","gloss":"thickness"}],"gloss":"thickness"},{"surface":"ஓதியும்","parts":[{"text":"ஓதி","lemma":"ஓதி","gloss":"hair"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and the hair"},{"surface":"புனையல்","parts":[{"text":"புனையல்","lemma":"புனை","gloss":"do not adorn"}],"gloss":"do not adorn"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"எம்மும்","parts":[{"text":"எம்","lemma":"யாம்","gloss":"me"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"me also"},{"surface":"தொடாஅல்","parts":[{"text":"தொடாஅல்","lemma":"தொடு","gloss":"do not touch"}],"gloss":"do not touch"},{"surface":"என்குவே","parts":[{"text":"என்குவே","lemma":"என்குவே","gloss":"I will say"}],"gloss":"I will say"},{"surface":"மன்","parts":[{"text":"மன்","lemma":"மன்","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"ஏ","parts":[{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"emphasis"}]}],"literal":"Look there, that indeed! This, what shall I say? / On the strong branch stayed, the dark-flocked birds, / because they united, of those who are separated, in the mind, / sweet voice to coo, having heard, he who left, / the stranger, here if he comes, like a flower bud, / thick hair do not adorn, / me also do not touch, I will say indeed!","translation":"Look there! That is it! What shall I say to this? If that stranger who left me comes back here, having heard the sweet voices of the dark-feathered birds perched on strong branches cooing because they have united—voices that pierce the hearts of those who are separated—I will surely say to him: 'Do not adorn my thick hair with flower buds, and do not touch me!'","modern":"அங்கே பார்! அதுதான்! இதற்கு நான் என்ன சொல்வேன்? வலிமையான கிளையில் அமர்ந்திருக்கும் கரிய கூட்டமாகிய பறவைகள், தாம் ஒன்று சேர்ந்த மகிழ்ச்சியால், பிரிந்திருப்பவர்களின் நெஞ்சில் வருத்தத்தை உண்டாக்கும்படி இனிமையான குரலில் கூவுவதைக் கேட்டு, நம்மை விட்டுப் பிரிந்து சென்ற அந்த அந்நியர் இப்போது இங்கே வந்தால், 'மலரும் மொட்டுகளைக் கொண்டு என் அடர்ந்த கூந்தலை அலங்கரிக்காதே; என்னைத் தொடவும் செய்யாதே' என்று நான் உறுதியாகக் கூறுவேன்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Mullai (forest) landscape, where the heroine is waiting for her husband's return during the rainy season. Seeing the birds happily united in pairs on the strong branches of trees, she feels the pain of separation, as their sweet cooing sounds like a torment to those who are lonely. She refers to her husband as a 'stranger' (ஏதிலாளர்) because he left her behind. In her playful anger (ஊடல்), she tells her friend that if he returns now, she will refuse to let him adorn her thick hair with flower buds and will forbid him from touching her. The imagery of the united birds contrasts sharply with her own solitude, highlighting her longing and feigned resentment.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.1,0.6],[1.18,1.5],[1.5,2.01],[2.01,2.39],[2.39,2.9],[2.97,3.3],[3.3,3.87],[3.93,4.2],[4.2,5.23],[5.23,5.7],[5.7,6.16],[6.16,6.63],[6.63,7.22],[7.22,7.68],[7.68,8.03],[8.03,8.5],[8.5,9.1],[9.1,9.33],[9.33,10.03],[10.03,10.23],[10.3,11.01],[11.01,11.6],[11.6,11.8],[11.8,13.4],[13.4,14.12],[14.12,14.6],[14.6,15.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.54],[0.54,1.1],[1.2,1.5],[1.6,1.96],[2.03,2.87],[2.87,3.7],[3.7,4.0],[4.0,4.7],[4.7,5.42],[5.42,5.9],[5.9,6.38],[6.38,7.0],[7.0,7.42],[7.42,7.75],[7.75,7.9],[7.9,8.9],[8.9,9.41],[9.41,9.76],[9.76,10.77],[10.77,10.94],[11.0,11.71],[11.71,12.3],[12.3,12.5],[12.5,12.8],[12.8,13.1],[13.1,13.4],[13.4,13.7]]},"sync":[[["உதுக்காண்","look there"]],[["உதுக்காண்","look there"],["அதுவே","that indeed"]],[["இது","this"],["என்","what"]],[["மொழிகோ","shall I say?"]],[["நோன்சினை","strong branch"]],[["இருந்த","which stayed"]],[["இருந்தோட்டு","of the dark flock"],["புள்ளினம்","flock of birds"]],[["புள்ளினம்","flock of birds"]],[["தாம்புணர்ந்",""]],[["தமையிற்",""]],[["பிரிந்தோ",""]],[["ருள்ளத்",""]],[["தீங்குரல்","sweet voice"]],[["அகவ","to coo"],["கேட்டு","having heard"]],[["கேட்டு","having heard"]],[["நீங்கிய","who left"]],[["ஏதிலாளர்","stranger"]],[["ஏதிலாளர்","stranger"]],[["ஏதிலாளர்","stranger"],["இவண்","here"],["வரின்","if he comes"]],[["போதின்","like a flower bud"]],[["பொம்மல்","thickness"]],[["பொம்மல்","thickness"],["ஓதியும்","and the hair"]],[["புனையல்","do not adorn"]],[["எம்மும்","me also"]],[["தொடாஅல்","do not touch"]],[["தொடாஅல்","do not touch"],["என்குவே","I will say"]],[["மன்","indeed"]]]}